00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:22,000
Once upon a time, there was a girl named Ina'nis.

3
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:26,800
She spent her days singing by the lake.

4
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:30,800
But one day,

5
