7
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:20,500
風がまた熱を連れてくる
The wind brings the heat back once again.

8
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,600
何千回も巡って
Passing by thousands of times,

9
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,800
