Shining tens of thousands of times,

10
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:31,500
そうやって光が生まれる
That is how the light is born.

11
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:47,300
日差しが溶けてる
The sunlight is melting,

12
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:50,000
空の向こう
Beyond the sky,

13
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:55,500
どこまでも透明な青
Into an endlessly transparent blue.

14
00:04:55,500 --> 00:05:00,000
スピードを上げた
I accelerated...

15
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,308
